{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03851","headline":"九江口南济北接蕲春南与浔阳岸 · 苏味道","name":"九江口南济北接蕲春南与浔阳岸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江路一悠哉，滔滔九派来。\n远潭昏似雾，前浦沸成雷。\n鳞介多潜育，渔商几泝洄。\n风摇蜀柹下，日照楚萍开。\n近漱湓城曲，斜吹蠡泽隈。\n锡龟犹入贡，浮兽罢爲灾。\n津吏挥桡疾，邮童整传催。\n归心讵可问，爲视落潮回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏味道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}